# Trivy ignore file for Grok Bot trading service
#
# Format: CVE-YYYY-NNNN or use regex for package names
# Add entries only for:
# 1. False positives confirmed not exploitable in this context
# 2. Vulnerabilities already patched in newer versions being deployed
# 3. Dependencies with no viable patches (documented with reason)
#
# Example:
# CVE-2023-12345  # false positive: only affects X, we use Y
# CVE-2024-99999  # patched in fastapi >= 1.0.0, deployed
